Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:02.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Okay, so I'm giving
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:02.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you an analogy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:02.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}たとえで言うとさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:02.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺らは今アルバムの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:06.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We're at the beginning of this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:06.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}album. Our life is the album.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:06.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}始まりにいるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:06.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}人生がアルバムで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:08.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Our world is a symphony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:08.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}世界は交響曲なんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We're playing on different
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}notes, but like Quincy Jones,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}みんな違う音を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}鳴らしてるけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:15.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}we have to bring it together and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:15.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}have us all play on one accord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:15.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Quincy Jonesみたいに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:15.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ひとつにまとめなきゃいけない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:17.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We're at the beginning of this album,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:17.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}俺らはまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:17.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}アルバムの1曲目にいるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and even if you go back, like, even J.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}例えば『Workout Plan』
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.61,0:00:21.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Cole sampled 'Workout Plan,' we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.61,0:00:21.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}could play 'Workout Plan,' right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.61,0:00:21.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}J. Coleもサンプリングしたけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.61,0:00:21.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}あの曲から始まるわけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:25.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But by the time we got to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:25.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}'Stronger,' it was a diamond record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:25.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でも『Stronger』の頃には
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:25.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ダイヤモンド・レコードに　なってた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:28.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We are in line for a diamond record,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:28.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}俺らは今
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:28.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ダイヤモンドに向かってる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}but we have to do some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}unorthodox things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でも型破りなことも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}やらなきゃいけない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}'Workout Plan' was, for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}me as a backpack rapper,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}リュック系ラッパーの俺が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.69,0:00:35.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}to have that song, or even, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.69,0:00:35.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}『Workout Plan』を出したり
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:38.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}be cursing or talking about the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:38.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}addictions I was dealing with,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:38.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}汚い言葉を使ったり
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:38.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}女好きとか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and my addiction to girls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and all this type of s**t,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}自分の依存症の話をしたりするのは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:44.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}was weird, because, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:44.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Mos Def wasn't talking about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:44.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}変だったんだよ　Mos Defも　Commonも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:45.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Common wasn't talking about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:45.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}そんな話しなかった
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:45.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ポジティブじゃないし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.67,0:00:48.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}because it's not positive,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.67,0:00:48.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}it's not backpack, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.67,0:00:48.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}リュック系っぽくないからな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But I leaned into my truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}でも俺は自分の本音に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I found that Playboy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}when I was five years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}正直になった
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}5歳でPlayboyを見つけて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and now I'm calling Irina Shayk,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and you know what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}今じゃIrina Shaykに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}電話してるんだから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.37,0:00:59.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So it's, it was my truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.37,0:00:59.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}それが俺の本音だった
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}but by the time we got to 'Stronger,'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}'work it harder, make it better,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でも『Stronger』
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}「Work it harder, make it better」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:07.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}faster, stronger,' that's my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:07.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}only diamond record, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:07.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}あれが俺の唯一の
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:07.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ダイヤモンド・レコードなんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:08.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:08.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:08.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}わかるだろ？
